The rails demo: a Rails 7.2 application whose packwerk packs checkout and pricing (checkout lists pricing in its package.yml) sit beside a local engine gem engines/admin, which the Gemfile names by path. The change adds a discount to pricing and bumps money in Gemfile.lock. Bundler 4.0 wrote Gemfile.lock, and RSpec 3.13 with rspec_junit_formatter 0.8 and SimpleCov 1.3 with simplecov-cobertura 4.0 wrote rspec.xml and coverage/coverage.xml on Ruby 3.3 (bundle exec rspec spec packs/*/spec engines/*/spec --format progress --format RspecJunitFormatter --out rspec.xml).
-- base/.gitignore --
/coverage/
/rspec.xml
/tmp/
/log/
-- base/.rspec --
--require spec_helper
-- base/Gemfile --
source "https://rubygems.org"

gem "rails", "~> 7.2.0"
gem "money", "~> 6.16"

# The back office, a local engine.
gem "admin", path: "engines/admin"

group :test do
  gem "rspec", "~> 3.13"
  gem "rspec_junit_formatter", "~> 0.6"
  gem "simplecov", "~> 1.0", require: false
  gem "simplecov-cobertura", "~> 4.0", require: false
end
